pay a possible new tax on billionaires in California. In return, he has promised to keep living in the state for eight years.", "lead_zh": "Meta与首席执行官马克·扎克伯格达成协议，帮他应对加州可能开征的富豪税。作为交换，他承诺未来八年继续住在加州。", "preview": "The company behind Facebook, Instagram and WhatsApp said the arrangement would keep Zuckerberg in California, where Meta has its headquarter", "preview_zh": "旗下拥有 Facebook、Instagram 和 WhatsApp 的 Meta 表示，这项安排能让扎克伯格留在加州，公司总部就在那里。根据协议，如果加州通过一次性富豪税，他将获得可以出售的新股份，用来支付数十亿美元的税单。作为交换，他同意未来八年继续住在加州，或住在 Meta", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 742, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 104.225, "size_bytes": 626256, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 106.675, "size_bytes": 640944, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/76/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 112.7, "size_bytes": 677088, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/76/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 98.775, "size_bytes": 593568, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/76/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 104.725, "size_bytes": 629280, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fed